+// cron-parser/3: the parser trims and splits on whitespace runs, and an empty expression defaults
+// to `0 * * * * *`, but a whitespace-only expression is rejected instead of defaulting.
+pin("TestHegelPinWhitespaceExpressionDefaults", () => {
